{"id": "EUVD-2026-98679", "enisaUuid": "d222c3f0-3b91-33a9-8c26-d1eb27e03407", "description": "Wazuh from 3.12.0 before 4.14.8 contains a heap buffer overflow in fim_generate_alert() where full_log is sized from input but written bounded by OS_MAXSTR. An enrolled agent can send a crafted FIM syscheck event to corrupt manager heap memory and deterministically crash wazuh-analysisd, causing a fleet-wide detection outage.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T13:27:32", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:47:59", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh/security/advisories/GHSA-gc4j-j9fg-4cfr", "https://github.com/wazuh/wazuh/releases/tag/v4.14.8", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wazuh-3.12.0-before-4.14.8-heap-buffer-overflow-in-wazuh-analysisd-fim-decoder"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-74045"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.34, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "65beca8e-befa-3bfb-8fa5-b222f46d80c1", "product": {"name": "wazuh-manager", "vendor": {"name": "wazuh"}}, "product_version": "3.12.0 <4.14.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5cc96d01-308f-372f-8a47-95ab4a2fc02d", "vendor": {"name": "wazuh"}}], "isExploited": false}